918,2025-02-04 00:00:00,2025,AI-Aided Scam in Thailand Allegedly Impersonates Police to Defraud 163 Victims,"Thai police arrested Ramil Pantawong and Thanawut Kanyaphan for allegedly using AI technology to impersonate police officers in a call scam. Based in Poipet, Cambodia, the gang tricked 163 victims, the most prominent of whom was Thai-British beauty queen Charlotte Austin, who lost 4 million baht (approximately $118,000 USD). Victims were falsely told they were under investigation and instructed to transfer money.","Thanawut Kanyaphan, Ramil Pantawong, Poipet Based Scam Gang",Deepfake Technology Developers,"General Public In Thailand, Charlotte Austin, 163 Victims Of Poipet Based Scam Gang",642188372947D07020C1319D,Deepfake Technology,,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
920,2025-02-01 00:00:00,2025,Alleged Deepfake Scam Reportedly Promoted Trump Golden Eagles Project as Investment Opportunity,"Reports surfaced of a purportedly AI-generated scam falsely promoting the Trump Golden Eagles Project. The purported deepfake videos of Donald Trump, Bank of America CEO Brian Moynihan, and Elon Musk are alleged to have claimed that buyers could trade collectible coins for cash or Tesla stock. A Bay Area veteran reportedly lost $2,500 believing he would earn millions. The scam reportedly circulated via Telegram, and Bank of America denied any involvement.","Unknown Scammers Behind The Trump Golden Eagles Scam, Scammers, Telegram Based Financial Scam Network, Investment Scam Operators","Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Media Generation Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","Wesley Skelton, Tesla, Spacex, Public Trust In Financial Institutions, General Public Of The United States, General Public, Epistemic Integrity, Elon Musk, Donald Trump, Brian Moynihan, Bay Area Residents Targeted By Trump Golden Eagles Scam, Bank Of America",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Deepfake Technology, Telegram Messaging Platform, Synthetic Media Generation Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",2026-06-16 13:46:10,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
921,2025-01-05 00:00:00,2025,"Hong Kong Authorities Seize HK$34M in Alleged Deepfake Scam Targeting Victims in Taiwan, Singapore, and Malaysia","Hong Kong police arrested 31 people linked to a deepfake scam syndicate that allegedly defrauded victims in Taiwan, Singapore, and Malaysia. The group used AI-generated images to impersonate wealthy women, training recruits to discuss luxury lifestyles, finance, and cryptocurrency to gain trust. Scammers reportedly persuaded victims to invest in fraudulent schemes, with police intercepting HK$34 million in illicit proceeds.",Hong Kong Based Deepfake Scam Syndicate,"Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Image Generation Technology","Victims Of Romance Scams In Taiwan, Victims Of Romance Scams In Singapore, Victims Of Romance Scams In Malaysia, Hong Kong Financial Regulators Investigating Fraud, Cryptocurrency Investors Defrauded By Ai Generated Profiles",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Social Media Platforms Used For Fraud, Cryptocurrency Trading Platforms, Ai Driven Text And Chatbot Manipulation Tools, Synthetic Image Generation Technology",2025-05-17 22:20:48,See also Incident 1066.,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
922,2025-02-04 00:00:00,2025,"AI Voice Scam Allegedly Defrauds Game and Coffee Store in Havre, Montana","A Montana business, Sugar and Dice, was reportedly targeted by an AI voice scam that cloned the store owner's voice to deceive an employee over the phone. The scammer allegedly spoofed both the owner's and the employee's phone numbers, making the call appear legitimate. Believing he was following his employer’s instructions, the employee unknowingly compromised financial details. The store suffered monetary losses but plans to recover.",Scammers,Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers,"Sugar And Dice, Kevin Zorn, Sugar And Dice Employee",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Caller Id Spoofing Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",AI,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,21,Intentional human misuse
923,2025-02-08 00:00:00,2025,"Nottingham Gallery Owner Allegedly Defrauded by Deepfake Impersonating Pierce Brosnan, Reportedly Leading to Business Closure","Nottingham gallery owner Simone Simms was allegedly deceived over many months by a deepfake impersonating actor Pierce Brosnan. Believing she was in direct contact with Brosnan, she reportedly arranged an art exhibition and sold £20,000 in tickets. When the real Brosnan denied involvement, Simms reportedly canceled the event and issued refunds. Despite acting in good faith, she reportedly faced reputational and financial harm, which led to the gallery’s closure in August 2024.","Scammers, Scammers Impersonating Pierce Brosnan",Deepfake Technology Developers,"Simone Simms, Nottingham Art Community, Long Eaton Gallery Customers, Long Eaton Gallery",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Deepfake Technology, Telegram, Facebook, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology, Synthetic Media Generation Technology, Synthetic Video Generation Technology",2026-06-16 13:36:25,"Reconstructing the reported timeline of events: (1) Sometime in early 2023, Simone Simms reportedly contacted what she believed to be Pierce Brosnan’s legitimate Facebook page to propose an exhibition of his artwork at her Nottingham gallery. (2) She was allegedly contacted by an entity she believed to be Brosnan, exchanging approximately 200 messages via Telegram, including voice notes and video calls featuring what appeared to be Brosnan’s likeness. (3) The scammers reportedly convinced Simms to send £3,000 for ""shipping fees"" related to the exhibition. (4) Over time, Simms promoted the event, selling approximately £20,000 worth of tickets, some of which included a £500 VIP meet-and-greet experience with Brosnan. (5) In November 2023, after the event was advertised, the real Pierce Brosnan publicly denied any involvement and issued a statement condemning the gallery, stating he ""would never charge for a meet-and-greet."" (6) Shortly thereafter, Brosnan’s legal representatives reportedly sent Simms a cease-and-desist letter, prompting her to refund all ticket sales. (7) In August 2024, Simms was reportedly forced to close her gallery, citing reputational damage and financial losses stemming from the incident. (8) On February 8, 2025, the Daily Mail published an exclusive report detailing Simms's experience.",MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",AI,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
924,2025-01-30 00:00:00,2025,Alleged Deepfake Scam Uses BBC Presenter Naga Munchetty’s Image to Promote Fraudulent Investment Scheme,BBC presenter Naga Munchetty was reportedly targeted in an AI-generated scam using deepfake images and fake news articles to promote a fraudulent investment scheme. Scam ads on social media allegedly featured manipulated images of Munchetty and linked to a fake BBC article directing users to a cyber trading website. The BBC legal team is reported to have taken action to remove the fraudulent site.,"Scammers Impersonating Naga Munchetty, Scammers",Deepfake Technology Developers,"Naga Munchetty, Bbc, Social Media Users, Fans Of Naga Munchetty",642188372947D07020C1319D,"X (Twitter), Facebook, Bluesky, Deepfake Technology",,,MIT,2,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",AI,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
927,2025-02-04 00:00:00,2025,Fraudsters Allegedly Use AI-Generated Voice of Italian Defense Minister Guido Crosetto to Scam Business Leaders,"In February 2025, scammers allegedly used AI voice cloning to impersonate Italian Defense Minister Guido Crosetto, calling top business leaders and reportedly claiming to need funds to free kidnapped journalists. Massimo Moratti was allegedly the only confirmed victim to send nearly €1M, wiring it to accounts in the Netherlands and Hong Kong before realizing the fraud. The scam involved spoofed government numbers, deepfake audio, and international money laundering networks. Police reportedly froze the funds.","Unknown Scammers Posing As Guido Crosetto, Scammers","Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","Patrizio Bertelli, Massimo Moratti, Marco Tronchetti Provera, Italian Business Leaders, Guido Crosetto, Giorgio Armani, Essilorluxottica, Esselunga, Del Vecchio Family, Caprotti Family, Caltagirone Family, Beretta Family, Aleotti Family",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",2025-02-12 23:16:47,"Massimo Moratti is reportedly the only confirmed victim to have sent money in the scam. However, multiple high-profile business figures were allegedly targeted, and their names are included for context.",MIT,26,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",AI,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
930,2025-02-12 00:00:00,2025,Alleged Deepfake Video Falsely Depicts Hollywood Stars in AI-Manipulated Protest Against Kanye West,"A deepfake video allegedly depicted Scarlett Johansson, Jerry Seinfeld, David Schwimmer, Lisa Kudrow, Steven Spielberg, Adam Sandler, Sacha Baron Cohen, Natalie Portman, Jake Gyllenhaal, Lenny Kravitz, Adam Levine, Drake, Mark Zuckerberg, Jack Black, Mila Kunis, Ben Stiller, and Woody Allen protesting Kanye West’s antisemitic remarks. The video falsely attributed statements to them, using AI to manipulate their likenesses without consent.","Ori Bejerano, Guy Bar, Gitam Bbdo",Deepfake Technology Developers,"Scarlett Johansson, Jerry Seinfeld, David Schwimmer, Lisa Kudrow, Steven Spielberg, Adam Sandler, Sacha Baron Cohen, Natalie Portman, Jake Gyllenhaal, Lenny Kravitz, Adam Levine, Drake, Mark Zuckerberg, Jack Black, Mila Kunis, Ben Stiller, Woody Allen",642188372947D07020C1319D,"X (Twitter), Instagram, Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",2025-02-19 22:35:03,,MIT,12,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
931,2025-01-21 00:00:00,2025,Reportedly Manipulated TikTok Videos Misrepresent Anti-AfD Protests as Far-Right Rallies,"TikTok videos purportedly depicted large crowds as chanting pro-AfD slogans by reportedly replacing the original audio with manipulated sound. The footage, originally from January 2024 anti-extremism protests, was repurposed in January 2025 to reportedly mislead viewers. Purported AI-generated or altered audio was added to create the illusion of far-right support. Fact-checkers confirmed the deception, and the accounts responsible later deleted the content, claiming no intent to spread misinformation.","Tiktok User Alice Weidel Fan, Tiktok User Afd John, Afd Supporters",Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers,"Protesters Against Right Wing Extremism In Germany, German Election Integrity, General Public Of Germany",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Tiktok, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",2025-05-09 01:59:02,"Please also refer to Incidents 909, 929, 1060, and 1061 for similar incidents. While this incident has not been explicitly attributed to Operation Overload (also known as Matryoshka or Storm-1679), its thematic content and manipulation tactics appear adjacent. No direct forensic or institutional linkage has been established as of this writing.",MIT,2,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Disinformation, surveillance, and influence at scale",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
933,2025-02-15 00:00:00,2025,Teenager in Palma de Mallorca Allegedly Generated and Distributed Deepfake Nudes of Five Classmates,"A teenager in Palma de Mallorca, Spain allegedly generated deepfake nudes of five classmates, reportedly taking their images from social media and using AI to alter them without their consent. He is reported to have shared the altered images with others.",Unnamed Adolescent Male In Palma De Mallorca,Deepfake Technology Developers,Unnamed Victims In Palma De Mallorca,642188372947D07020C1319D,Deepfake Technology,,,MIT,11,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
934,2025-02-10 00:00:00,2025,NHK Terminates AI Translation Service After Geopolitical Naming Error,"NHK announced the termination of its AI-powered multilingual subtitle service after an automatic translation error rendered ""Senkaku Islands"" as ""Diaoyu Islands,"" the Chinese designation. The mistake, discovered on February 10th, 2025 during a news segment, led NHK to deem the service inappropriate. The AI-based subtitles, powered by Google Translate, had been in use since 2020.",Nhk,Google,"Nhk, Government Of Japan, Nhk Viewers, Public Trust In The Media, Japan China Relations",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Google Translate Api, Nhk Ai Subtitle Translator, Nhk Live Streaming Service",,,MIT,3,Misinformation,False or misleading information,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional AI misuse
935,2025-02-17 00:00:00,2025,Reported Deepfake of Maltese Prime Minister Robert Abela and Journalist Mark Laurence Zammit Used to Promote Fraudulent Investment,"A deepfake scam allegedly used AI-generated audio to mimic Maltese Prime Minister Robert Abela and journalist Mark Laurence Zammit, falsely portraying them as endorsing an investment scheme. The fraudulent video repurposed genuine interview footage from 2022 but replaced the original dialogue with AI-generated voices.","Scammers Impersonating Robert Abela And Mark Laurence Zammit, Scammers","Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","Robert Abela, Mark Laurence Zammit, General Public Of Malta, General Public, Epistemic Integrity",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",2025-11-29 23:02:43,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",AI,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
937,2025-02-10 00:00:00,2025,Bolivian Criminal Network Allegedly Used Deepfake of Education Minister to Defraud at Least 19 Victims in Employment Scam,"A Bolivian criminal network allegedly used AI-generated deepfake audio of Education Minister Omar Véliz Ramos to impersonate him in phone calls, defrauding at least 19 victims in a fake job scheme. Scammers reportedly lured applicants via social media, used cloned voices for credibility, and demanded payment via QR codes. Authorities uncovered the scheme, seizing devices and arresting multiple suspects, including one orchestrating the fraud from prison. Losses reportedly exceed $720,000 USD.","Vilma C.C., Scammers Impersonating Omar Veliz Ramos, Scammers, Mariana A.S., Luis G.C., Jackelin A.M., Alfredo Ch. S.","Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers, Deepfake Technology Developers","Unnamed Servicio Departamental De Salud (Sedes) Potosi Official, Omar Veliz Ramos, Ministry Of Education Of Bolivia, General Public Of Bolivia, At Least 19 Bolivian Citizens Seeking Employment, Targets Of Fraudulent Professional Opportunities",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Whatsapp, Various Mobile Banking Apps, Tiktok, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology, Facebook, Deepfake Technology",2026-08-29 18:12:48,"An unnamed official with the Servicio Departamental de Salud (SEDES) Potosí was also reportedly deepfaked in this scam, but most details on the reporting center on the Minister of Education. The incident date of 2/10/2025 marks early reporting on the incident; the scam was likely operating throughout January and early February of 2025.",MIT,4,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
938,2025-02-01 00:00:00,2025,"Purportedly AI-Assisted Impersonation of Martin Henderson in Romance Scam Leads to Reported NZ$375,000 Fraud","An alleged online romance scam exploiting AI-assisted impersonation defrauded a woman, ""Lea,"" of NZ$375,000 over two years. The scammer allegedly used AI-generated voice messages and deceptive text communication to pose as New Zealand actor Martin Henderson and is reported to have built up a relationship beginning in early 2023. The victim, believing the scam was real, reportedly relocated to New Zealand in December 2024, only discovering the fraud in February 2025.","Unknown Scammer Impersonating Martin Henderson, Scammers","Deepfake Technology Developers, Large Language Model Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","Martin Henderson, Lea (Pseudonym)",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Large Language Models, Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",2025-08-12 14:40:44,"While this particular incident is reported to have taken place from early 2023 to February 1, 2025, Martin Henderson had previously warned about similar scams. On July 25, 2022, he posted on Instagram about fraudulent accounts impersonating him to deceive followers: https://www.instagram.com/p/CgdL6jMpgFE/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link.",MIT,6,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
939,2025-02-21 00:00:00,2025,AI-Powered Chinese Surveillance Campaign 'Peer Review' Used for Real-Time Monitoring of Anti-State Speech on Western Social Media,"OpenAI reportedly uncovered evidence of a Chinese state-linked AI-powered surveillance campaign, dubbed ""Peer Review,"" designed to monitor and report anti-state speech on Western social media in real time. The system, believed to be built on Meta’s open-source Llama model, was detected when a developer allegedly used OpenAI’s technology to debug its code. OpenAI also reportedly identified disinformation efforts targeting Chinese dissidents and spreading propaganda in Latin America.","Chinese State Linked Actors, Chinese Communist Party","Various Open Source Ai Developers, Openai, Meta, Chinese State Security Researchers, Surveillance Technology Developers","Western Social Media Communities, Social Media Users In Latin America, Social Media Users, Opposition Voices Against The Chinese Communist Party, Chinese Dissidents, Cai Xia, Privacy",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Peer Review, Openai Models, Llama, Chatgpt, Surveillance Technology",2026-05-29 15:09:34,,MIT,6,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Disinformation, surveillance, and influence at scale",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
940,2025-02-17 00:00:00,2025,Tesla Cybertruck Operating in Full Self-Driving Mode Reportedly Crashes into Pole in Nevada After Failing to Merge,"A Tesla Cybertruck operating in Full Self-Driving (FSD) mode reportedly crashed into a pole in Reno, Nevada, after failing to merge out of a lane that was ending. The driver, who was required to remain in control, stated that unknown mechanical issues caused the vehicle to leave the lane. ",Tesla,Tesla,"Jonathan Challinger, Tesla Drivers, Motorists",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Tesla Full Self Driving (Fsd), Tesla Vision, Tesla Autopilot",,,MIT,8,"AI system safety, failures, and limitations",Lack of capability or robustness,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,2,Unintentional AI misuse
941,2025-02-17 00:00:00,2025,AI-Driven Phishing Scam Uses Deepfake Robocalls to Target Gmail Users in Credential Theft Campaign,"A sophisticated AI-powered phishing scam has reportedly been targeting between 1.8 to 2.5 billion Gmail users, allegedly using deepfake robocalls and phishing emails to steal credentials. Attackers impersonate Google security. They claim suspicious account activity and direct victims to fake Google login pages. The stolen credentials have reportedly been used for identity theft, banking fraud, and session hijacking. The FBI has urged vigilance as AI increases the scale and effectiveness of such attacks.","Scammers Impersonating Google Employees, Cybercriminals, Scammers","Unknown Ai Tool Providers, Deepfake Technology Developers","Google Users, Gmail Users",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Unknown Robocall System, Google Authentication System, Gmail, Deepfake Technology",2025-02-23 13:53:33,"The incident date of 05/08/2024 refers to the publication of the FBI San Francisco office's alert. The scams had presumably been ongoing for a while before the alert. A significant uptick in reporting occurred in late January and early February 2025, often citing that FBI warning. For specific variations of these attacks, please also refer Incidents 839 and 942.",MIT,13,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",AI,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
942,2025-02-20 00:00:00,2025,Cybercriminals Reportedly Exploited Google’s G.Co Subdomain and Spoofed Caller ID in AI-Driven Phishing Attack on Hack Club Founder,"Hack Club founder Zach Latta was reportedly targeted in an AI-assisted phishing attack exploiting Google’s own systems. Cybercriminals allegedly spoofed a legitimate Google Assistant number and used voice cloning to impersonate support staff, claiming unusual login activity from Frankfurt. They reinforced the deception by sending a real email from Google’s Workspace domain. The attack, which relied on Google’s g.co subdomain, was thwarted when inconsistencies raised Latta’s suspicions.","Voice Phishers, Scammers Impersonating Google Staff, Scammers",Synthetic Audio Generation Technology,"Zach Latta, Google Users",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Google Workspace, Google Authentication System, Google Assistant, Google'S G.Co Subdomain, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",2025-02-23 13:53:04,"01/20/2025 is an approximate date; the attack presumably occurred sometime between January 20 and January 26, 2025. Please also refer to Incidents 839 and 941.",MIT,8,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
943,2025-02-20 00:00:00,2025,"Nonconsensual Explicit AI-Generated Images of Up to 60 Gladstone Park Secondary College Students in Victoria, Australia, Reportedly Created and Circulated Online","Purportedly AI-generated explicit images of up to 60 female students at Gladstone Park Secondary College in Victoria, Australia, were reportedly created and circulated online. The images were reportedly altered from formal school photos using AI tools to produce nonconsensual explicit content. Two Year 11 students have been suspended, but the full number of individuals involved remains unclear as the investigation is ongoing.","Two Unidentified Year 11 Students At Gladstone Park Secondary College, Students, High School Students, Synthetic Media Creators, Deepfake Creators","Synthetic Media Generation Technology Developers, Synthetic Image Generation Technology Developers, Deepfake Technology Developers","Women And Girls, Up To 60 Unnamed Students At Gladstone Park Secondary College, Students, High School Students, Gladstone Park Secondary College Students, Gladstone Park Secondary College, Girls, Families Of Gladstone Park Secondary College Students, Educational Communities, Adolescent Girls",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Synthetic Media Generation Technology, Synthetic Image Generation Technology, Deepfake Technology, Ai Nudification Tools",2026-09-05 06:04:04,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
