945,2025-02-19 00:00:00,2025,"Two 16-Year-Old Students in Athens, Greece Allegedly Generated Nonconsensual Deepfake Pornography of Their Classmates","In Athens, Greece, two 16-year-old students were arrested for allegedly generated nonconsensual deepfake pornography of their classmates. They reportedly used images taken from social media to create the explicit images, which they are then reported to have disseminated online to others. The parents of the students were reportedly also arrested for neglecting to supervise their behavior.","Two Unnamed 16 Year Old Students In Athens, Students, Minors",Deepfake Technology Developers,"Students At A High School In Athens, Families Of Students At A High School In Athens, Students, Minors, Educational Communities, Epistemic Integrity",642188372947D07020C1319D,Deepfake Technology Developers,2026-05-18 12:45:53,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
948,2025-02-23 00:00:00,2025,Alleged FraudGPT-Enabled Phishing Attack Spoofs ChatGPT Subscription Service to Steal Credentials,"A reported phishing campaign is impersonating OpenAI’s ChatGPT Premium subscription service, using AI-generated emails to steal user credentials and financial data. Cybercriminals are allegedly sending fraudulent renewal requests urging victims to update payment details, directing them to spoofed OpenAI login pages. ","Cybercriminals, Phishing Scammers, Fraudgpt Operators, Dark Web Threat Actors, Scammers","Fraudgpt, Openai","Openai Users, Chatgpt",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Fraudgpt, Chatgpt",,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
949,2025-02-24 00:00:00,2025,Unauthorized AI-Generated Video of Donald Trump and Elon Musk Reportedly Appears on HUD Building Screens,"An unauthorized satirical AI-generated video reportedly depicting President Trump kissing Elon Musk’s feet played on TV screens within the Department of Housing and Urban Development (HUD) building, seemingly mocking their relationship. The video is reported to have included the phrase “Long live the real king,” referencing a recent Truth Social post by Trump.",Unnamed,Deepfake Technology Developers,"Department Of Housing And Urban Development (Hud), Donald Trump, Elon Musk",642188372947D07020C1319D,Deepfake Technology,,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
951,2025-02-24 00:00:00,2025,Character.AI Chatbots Allegedly Impersonating Licensed Therapists and Encouraging Harmful Behaviors,"The American Psychological Association (APA) has warned federal regulators that AI chatbots on Character.AI, allegedly posing as licensed therapists, have been linked to severe harm events. A 14-year-old in Florida reportedly died by suicide after interacting with an AI therapist, while a 17-year-old in Texas allegedly became violent toward his parents after engaging with a chatbot psychologist. Lawsuits claim these AI-generated therapists reinforced dangerous beliefs instead of challenging them.",Character.Ai,Character.Ai,"Sewell Setzer Iii, J.F. (Texas Teenager)",642188372947D07020C1319D,Character.Ai,2025-06-19 20:34:58,"See also Incident 1108. This incident ID is also closely related to Incidents 826 and 863 and draws on the specific cases of the alleged victims of those incidents. The specifics pertaining to Sewell Setzer III are detailed in Incident 826, although the initial reporting focuses on his interactions with a chatbot modeled after a Game of Thrones character and not a therapist. Similarly, the teenager known as J.F. is discussed in Incident 863. For this incident ID, reporting on the specific harm events that may arise as a result of interactions with AI-powered chatbots performing as therapists will be tracked.",MIT,2,Human-Computer Interaction,Overreliance and unsafe use,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional AI misuse
952,2025-02-25 00:00:00,2025,Apple’s Voice Dictation Reportedly Substitutes ‘Trump’ for ‘Racist’ Due to Speech Recognition Bug,"Apple's iPhone dictation feature reportedly displayed ""Trump"" when users dictated the word ""racist,"" with a viral video demonstrating the glitch. Apple acknowledged the bug, attributing it to a phonetic overlap in its speech recognition model, though some speculated it could be an internal prank. The company announced an immediate fix.",Apple,Apple,"Apple Users, Donald Trump",642188372947D07020C1319D,Iphone,,,MIT,1,"AI system safety, failures, and limitations",Lack of capability or robustness,AI,Other,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,
954,2025-02-04 00:00:00,2025,Chatbots Allegedly Used in Romance Scams Targeting Nearly One-Third of New Zealand's Dating App Users,"A Norton Cyber Safety Insights Report found that nearly one-third of New Zealand dating app users have been targeted by romance scams, with AI chatbots allegedly playing a growing role. The report, based on a January 2025 survey, indicates that 50% of dating app users believed they had interacted with AI-generated messages. Private investigators report cases where victims engage in long-term virtual relationships with fraudsters, often sending money.","Romance Scammers Targeting New Zealanders, Scammers","Large Language Model Developers, Chatbot Developers","New Zealand Dating App Users, Romance Scam Victims, Financial Scam Victims",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Social Media Platforms, Dating Apps, Large Language Models, Chatbots",,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
956,2025-02-28 00:00:00,2025,"Alleged Inclusion of 12,000 Live API Keys in LLM Training Data Reportedly Poses Security Risks","A dataset used to train large language models allegedly contained 12,000 live API keys and authentication credentials. Some of these were reportedly still active and allowed unauthorized access. Truffle Security found these secrets in a December 2024 Common Crawl archive, which spans 250 billion web pages. The affected credentials could have been exploited for unauthorized data access, service disruptions, financial fraud, and a variety of other malicious uses.","Microsoft, Openai, Common Crawl, Microsoft Azure Openai Service","Common Crawl, Openai, Microsoft","Aws, Slack, Mailchimp, Microsoft, Google, Intel, Huawei, Paypal, Ibm, Tencent",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Common Crawl Dataset (December 2024 Archive), Microsoft Copilot, Google Gemini, Anthropic Claude, Chatgpt, Xai Grok, Deepseek, Llms Trained On Compromised Data",,,MIT,1,Privacy & Security,"Compromise of privacy by obtaining, leaking or correctly inferring sensitive information",Human,Unintentional,Pre-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional human misuse
957,2025-02-28 00:00:00,2025,Alleged Instagram Algorithm Malfunction Floods Users' Reels Feeds with Violent and Graphic Content,"An alleged Instagram algorithm malfunction caused users' Reels feeds to be overwhelmed with violent and distressing content. Many reported seeing deaths, extreme brutality, and other graphic material in rapid succession, often without prior engagement with similar content. The sudden exposure caused psychological distress for many users, with minors and vulnerable individuals particularly affected by the graphic content. Meta confirmed an AI failure was responsible and apologized.",Meta,Meta,"Minors, Meta Users, Instagram Users",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Instagram Reels, Instagram Recommendation Algorithm",2025-08-12 14:34:03,,MIT,1,Discrimination and Toxicity,Exposure to toxic content,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,8,Unintentional AI misuse
958,2025-02-26 00:00:00,2025,Europol Operation Cumberland Investigates at Least 273 Suspects in 19 Countries for AI-Generated Child Sexual Abuse Material,Europol’s Operation Cumberland uncovered a global network distributing AI-generated child sexual abuse material (CSAM). The operation has led to 25 arrests and 273 identified suspects across 19 countries. The AI-enabled abuse allows criminals to create exploitative content at scale with minimal expertise. ,"Suspects Identified In Operation Cumberland, Csam Distributors, Deepfake Creators","Deepfake Technology Developers, Deepfake Csam Technology Developers, Deepfake Csam Technology","Minors, Epistemic Integrity, Victims Of Exploitation, Child Sexual Abuse Victims, Victims Of Deepfake Abuse, Victims Of Deepfake Child Abuse",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Deepfake Technology, Dark Web Marketplaces, Deepfake Csam Technology",2026-06-09 15:54:55,"Timeline notes: The first reported arrest was sometime in November 2024 of a Danish national, which led to the authorities uncovering an online platform distributing AI-generated CSAM. On February 26, 2025, Operation Cumberland was launched. The initial wave of actions reportedly led to 25 arrests, 33 house searches, and 173 seizures of electronic devices across 19 different countries. The investigation is ongoing.",MIT,11,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
959,2025-03-02 00:00:00,2025,Deepfake Video of Indonesian President Prabowo Subianto and Other Officials Reportedly Used in Scam to Defraud Citizens Across 20 Provinces,"A deepfake scam allegedly using AI-generated videos of Indonesian President Prabowo Subianto and other officials reportedly defrauded victims across 20 provinces, tricking them into paying Rp 250,000 to Rp 1 million ($15-$60) for purported financial aid. The fraudulent clips, circulated on TikTok, Instagram, and WhatsApp, appeared to show Prabowo offering assistance. Police reportedly arrested two suspects in February 2025, but deepfake scams exploiting high-profile figures continue to spread.","Scammers Impersonating Prabowo Subianto, Scammers","Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","General Public Of Indonesia, Prabowo Subianto, Government Of Indonesia, Gibran Rakabuming Raka, Indonesian Government Officials",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",,"Reconstructing the timeline of reported events: (1) November 2024: At some point this month, a deepfake video allegedly featuring Indonesian President Prabowo Subianto appears on Instagram where he is depicted offering financial aid and asking viewers to contact a WhatsApp number to claim assistance. The scam requires victims to pay Rp 250,000 to Rp 1 million ($15-$60) in administrative fees. (2) Between November 2024 and February 2025: Fraudulent videos along these lines reportedly continue spreading across TikTok, Instagram, and WhatsApp, with at least 22 TikTok accounts promoting the scam under hashtags like ""Prabowo shares blessings."" Some videos are reported to have racked up millions of views. Some of them also feature Vice President Gibran Rakabuming Raka and other public figures. (3) February 2025: Indonesian police arrest a suspect allegedly involved in the deepfake scam. The investigation reveals the scammer had collected Rp 65 million ($4,000) from victims. A second suspect is detained for a separate deepfake-related fraud, but authorities have not as of yet disclosed further details. (4) Between February and March 2025: Despite arrests, deepfake videos have continued circulating on social media of a similar vein. Fact-checkers from AFP and Indonesian media organizations have been working to identify more accounts pushing similar scams. TikTok is reported to have removed at least one account, but many are apparently remaining active. We are marking 11/01/2024 as the incident date, although most reporting on this incident began on 03/02/2025.",MIT,4,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
960,2025-02-06 00:00:00,2025,Plaintiffs' Lawyers Admit AI Generated Erroneous Case Citations in Federal Court Filing Against Walmart,"Lawyers Rudwin Ayala, T. Michael Morgan (Morgan & Morgan), and Taly Goody (Goody Law Group) were fined a total of $5,000 after their Wyoming federal lawsuit filing against Walmart cited fake cases ""hallucinated"" by AI. Judge Kelly Rankin sanctioned them, removing Ayala from the case and noting attorneys must verify AI sources. The filing, flagged by Walmart’s legal team, led to its withdrawal and an internal review.","Taly Goody, T. Michael Morgan, Rudwin Ayala, Morgan And Morgan, Goody Law Group",Large Language Model Developers,"Taly Goody, T. Michael Morgan, Rudwin Ayala, Plaintiffs In Wyoming Walmart Hoverboard Lawsuit, Legal System, Judicial Integrity, Clients Of Morgan And Morgan, Clients Of Goody Law Group",642188372947D07020C1319D,Large Language Models,2025-03-05 00:01:13,"Judge Kelly Rankin's ""Order to Show Cause Why Plaintiffs’ Attorneys Should Not Be Sanctioned or Other Disciplinary Action Should Not Issue"" of February 6th, 2025 can be accessed at the following URL: https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.wyd.64014/gov.uscourts.wyd.64014.156.0_1.pdf. The later ""Order on Sanctions and Other Disciplinary Action"" of February 24th, 2025 can be accessed here: https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.wyd.64014/gov.uscourts.wyd.64014.181.0_1.pdf.",MIT,11,Misinformation,False or misleading information,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional AI misuse
962,2025-03-05 00:00:00,2025,"Tbilisi-Based Call Center Allegedly Uses AI-Driven Scripts to Defraud Over 6,000 Victims of $35 Million","A large-scale AI-assisted financial scam, allegedly operated from Tbilisi, Georgia, used deepfake celebrity endorsements and manipulated victims through fraudulent trading dashboards that simulated high returns. Call center agents, trained with AI-driven persuasion tactics, convinced individuals to invest more money while falsely promising profits. Many reportedly lost their life savings, with the total losses reaching $35M across more than 6,000 victims.","Scammer Operatives In Georgia Bulgaria Cyprus And Spain, Meri Shotadze, Golden Currencies, Akaki Kevkhishvili, Ak Group, Admiralsfx","Third Party Ai Service Providers For Call Center Training, Fraudulent Trading Platform Developers, Deepfake Technology Developers","Small Business Owners, Retirees Seeking Investment Opportunities, People With Neurological Disorders, Individuals Deceived By Celebrity Deepfake Impersonations, Financial Professionals, Elderly Investors, Financial Scam Victims",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Fraudulent Investment Platforms With Ai Powered Simulations, Automated Call Center Ai Assistants, Anydesk, Ai Generated Trading Dashboards, Affiliate Marketing Networks Using Ai For Scam Targeting, Deepfake Technology",2025-03-06 12:25:08,"Note on the timeline: These scams began sometime in May 2022, but The Guardian's investigation was published on 03/05/2025.",MIT,2,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",AI,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
