1007,2025-03-13 00:00:00,2025,AI-Generated Voice Cloning of Trump Falsely Proposes Renaming the District of Columbia to the District of America,"A viral audio clip circulating on TikTok, Facebook, X, and other platforms falsely portrayed Donald Trump saying he would rename Washington, D.C. as the ""District of America."" The voice was confirmed to be AI-generated by digital forensics experts. It was initially posted by a now-deleted TikTok account. The clip is reported to have spread rapidly across political lines before it was debunked.",Unknown Tiktok User,"Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","Donald Trump, General Public, Social Media Users, Epistemic Integrity",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Tiktok, Facebook, X (Twitter), Social Media Platforms, Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Disinformation, surveillance, and influence at scale",AI,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
1008,2025-02-10 00:00:00,2025,"AI-Generated Voice Purporting to Be Daughter Allegedly Used to Coerce $2,000 from Colorado Mother","In February 2025, a Colorado woman was scammed by a voice-cloning fraud in which criminals used what sounded like her daughter’s voice to stage a fake kidnapping. Under duress and believing her daughter was in danger, she wired $2,000 to Mexico. The scammers exploited generative AI to simulate the daughter’s voice and manipulated the victim psychologically. Law enforcement could not trace the perpetrators or recover the funds.","Unknown Scammers Operating In Mexico, Unknown Scammers Impersonating Daughter Of Linda Roan, Scammers",Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers,"Linda Roan, Daughter Of Linda Roan, General Public",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Western Union, Moneygram, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",,"Incident date note: Reporting states that the scam occurred on ""a Monday evening in February [2025]""; the incident date of 02/10/2025 is a placeholder until the more precise date might be ascertained.",MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
1009,2025-02-13 00:00:00,2025,Purportedly AI-Assisted Report by Tromsø Officials Allegedly Cited Non-Existent Sources in School Closure Proposal,"In February 2025, Tromsø Municipality reportedly presented a report proposing the closure of schools and kindergartens. Residents reportedly later discovered the report cited numerous non-existent sources. Officials reportedly admitted using generative AI to help draft the report, leading to fabricated references. The incident reportedly led to public outcry and suspension of the closure plan. It is purportedly Norway's first major public-sector AI scandal.","Tromso Municipality, Stig Tore Johnsen",Large Language Model Developers,"Thomas Nordahl, General Public Of Tromso, General Public Of Norway, Students, Teachers, Minors, Educational Communities, Epistemic Integrity",642188372947D07020C1319D,Large Language Models,2026-05-17 23:38:10,"A couple of notes on two figures who appear in the reporting: Stig Tore Johnsen is the kommunedirektør (municipal chief executive) of Tromsø Municipality. While he publicly accepted responsibility for the inclusion of AI-generated content in the school closure report, there is no indication that he personally deployed the AI system. Thomas Nordahl, a professor whose name was falsely cited in the report as the author of a non-existent book, appears more amused than aggrieved. His public comment suggests concern over the misuse of his name, but not a claim of reputational harm.",MIT,4,Misinformation,False or misleading information,Human,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional human misuse
1010,2025-03-31 00:00:00,2025,"GenNomis AI Database Reportedly Exposes Nearly 100,000 Deepfake and Nudify Images in Public Breach","In March 2025, cybersecurity researcher Jeremiah Fowler discovered an unprotected database linked to GenNomis by AI-NOMIS, a South Korean company offering face-swapping and ""nudify"" AI services. The exposed 47.8GB dataset included nearly 100,000 files. Many depicted explicit deepfake images, some involving minors or celebrities. No personal data was found, but the breach was a serious failure in data security and consent safeguards in AI image-generation platforms.","Gennomis By Ai Nomis, Gennomis","Gennomis By Ai Nomis, Ai Nomis","Public Figures And Celebrities Depicted In Explicit Ai Images, Minors, Individuals Whose Likenesses Were Used Without Consent, General Public, Privacy, Epistemic Integrity",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Unnamed Cloud Database, Gennomis, Ai Nudification Tools",2026-05-29 14:59:49,,MIT,2,Privacy & Security,"Compromise of privacy by obtaining, leaking or correctly inferring sensitive information",Human,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional human misuse
1011,2025-04-05 00:00:00,2025,Deepfake of Bermuda Premier David Burt Promotes Investment Scam Using Royal Gazette Branding,The Government of Bermuda warned the public about a deepfake video circulating on Facebook that falsely portrayed Premier David Burt promoting a government investment scheme. The deepfake video reportedly mimicked the branding of The Royal Gazette and was linked to fraudulent social media accounts. Authorities confirmed the content was fake and urged the public to report such scams and to be vigilant about them.,"Scammers Impersonating David Burt, Scammers","Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","David Burt, Government Of Bermuda, General Public Of Bermuda, The Royal Gazette",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Facebook, Social Media Platforms, Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
1012,2025-04-03 00:00:00,2025,AI Voice Clone of Texas Woman Used in Distress Scam Targeting Brother in Port Neches,"Jace Edgar of Port Neches, Texas reportedly received a scam phone call using AI-generated voice cloning to mimic his sister in distress. Believing she had been in an accident, Edgar began to act before noticing the caller avoided direct questions. When he contacted his sister, she was unharmed and unaware of the call. Authorities confirmed this was part of a broader rise in AI-powered scams, urging the public to stay vigilant and avoid sharing personal info with unknown callers.","Scammers Impersonating Jayla (Sister Of Jace Edgar), Scammers",Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers,"Jace Edgar, Jayla (Sister Of Jace Edgar)",642188372947D07020C1319D,Synthetic Audio Generation Technology,,Reporting does not give Jayla's surname; database tagging links her with Jace Edgar in lieu of more information.,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
1013,2025-04-04 00:00:00,2025,Essex Man Sentenced to Five Years in Prison for Having Generated and Shared Deepfake Pornography of at Least 20 Women and a Minor,"Between March 2023 and May 2024, Brandon Tyler of Essex used AI to generate explicit deepfake pornography of at least 20 women he knew personally, including a 16-year-old. He manipulated their social media photos and shared them, along with their personal details, in online forums promoting sexual violence. He was sentenced to five years in prison in April 2025 under the UK's criminal law against sharing sexually explicit deepfakes, in what is one of the first major prosecutions of its kind.",Brandon Tyler,Deepfake Technology Developers,"Victims Of Brandon Tyler, General Public",642188372947D07020C1319D,Deepfake Technology,,"Notes on the timeline: Brandon Tyler's actions reportedly began sometime in March 2023 and continued until May 2024, which is when he was arrested. He was sentenced on April 4, 2025 (which is the incident date selected for this incident ID). It is also the date when reporting seemingly emerged for this incident.",MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
1015,2025-04-07 00:00:00,2025,Reported Darknet Launch of Xanthorox AI Introduces Autonomous Cyberattack Platform,"Xanthorox AI is a malicious, modular AI system released on darknet forums in early 2025. Designed from scratch for offensive cyber operations, it runs on private infrastructure and includes models for code generation, phishing, malware, social engineering, and real-time voice/image input. Its release represents a deliberate deployment of an autonomous attack platform.","Unknown Malicious Actors, Darknet Forum Users, Cybercriminals","Xanthorox Ai Creators, Unknown Black Hat Ai Developers","Victims Of Phishing Attacks, Victims Of Malware Attacks, Victims Of Automated Cybercrime, General Public, Enterprise It Systems, Critical Infrastructure Systems",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Xanthorox Vision, Xanthorox Reasoner Advanced, Xanthorox Coder, Xanthorox Ai, Voice And Image Handling Modules, Live Web Scraping Module",2025-04-09 21:43:07,"At present we are unaware of any incident involving Xanthorox, but its release, capabilities, indicated purpose, and wide availability lead us to believe that the absence of current evidence is more the result of inadequate time or reporting and less the absence of past or imminent harm. If and when the first harm event occurs (i.e., ""incident"") we will add its reports to this incident ID. You can subscribe to this incident number to receive an email notification should that occur.",MIT,3,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Cyberattacks, weapon development or use, and mass harm",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
