1019,2025-04-10 00:00:00,2025,Alleged AI-Generated Clone of Exante Brokerage Used to Defraud U.S. Investor via JPMorgan Account,"Scammers used AI tools to clone the broker Exante and defraud at least one U.S. victim by registering a JPMorgan Chase account and replicating Exante’s trading interface. AI-generated fake documents, deepfakes, and cloned websites enabled the scheme. Exante, which does not operate in the U.S., confirmed the fraud and filed reports with multiple U.S. agencies.","Scammers Cloning Exante, Scammers","Openai, Generative Ai Developers","Individual Investors, Exante, Jpmorgan Chase",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Jpmorgan Chase Banking Systems, Cloned Exante Web Interface, Gpt 4O",,"While generative AI–produced identity documents were not explicitly confirmed in this case, their use is consistent with reported capabilities and plausibly supported the creation of financial infrastructure. This incident report treats them as a likely—but not definitively verified—component of the broader scam operation. See also Incident 1018, ""OpenAI's 4o Model Reportedly Enables Fraudulent Document Generation.""",MIT,2,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
