1101,2025-04-29 00:00:00,2025,Meta AI App Reportedly Publishes Personal Chats Without Users Fully Realizing,"Meta launched a stand-alone AI app with a ""Discover"" feed allowing users to share conversations with its chatbot. Multiple reports indicate that some users may have inadvertently published highly personal interactions, including audio recordings, medical questions, legal concerns, and intimate relationship disclosures. While Meta states that sharing is opt-in, the feature's design and labeling may have led to user confusion about what would be publicly visible.",Meta,"Meta, Large Language Model Developers, Chatbot Developers","Meta Users, Meta Ai Users, Chatbot Users, Privacy, Biometric Data Subjects",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Meta Ai, Large Language Models, Chatbots",2026-08-31 17:35:52,,MIT,3,Privacy & Security,"Compromise of privacy by obtaining, leaking or correctly inferring sensitive information",Human,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,8,Unintentional human misuse
1102,2025-04-30 00:00:00,2025,Purported Deepfake Featuring Dr. Rinki Murphy and Jack Tame Reportedly Used to Promote Diabetes Scam in New Zealand,"A purported AI-generated deepfake video reportedly impersonated Auckland University diabetes expert Dr. Rinki Murphy, depicting her in a TVNZ interview with journalist Jack Tame promoting a fake diabetes cure. The alleged scam video circulated on social media in April–June 2025, prompting concern that New Zealanders were deceived into stopping prescribed medications. Despite reporting the incident, new variants of the video reportedly continued to emerge.",Scammers,"Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","Rinki Murphy, Jack Tame, Diabetes Patients, Diabetes Patients In New Zealand, General Public Of New Zealand",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",,,MIT,2,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,21,Intentional human misuse
