1104,2025-05-17 00:00:00,2025,AI Chatbot Allegedly Used to Research Explosive Materials in Palm Springs Fertility Clinic Bombing,"An unnamed AI chatbot was reportedly used by Guy Edward Bartkus and Daniel Park, the perpetrators of the 2025 Palm Springs fertility clinic bombing, to research explosive materials and optimize fuel mixtures. Records show the chatbot responded to queries related to ammonium nitrate fuel oil (ANFO) composition. The bombing resulted in one death, four injuries, and significant structural damage.","Guy Edward Bartkus, Daniel Park",Large Language Model Developers,"Staff Of American Reproductive Centers In Palm Springs, Patients Of American Reproductive Centers In Palm Springs, Occupants And Residents Of Buildings Adjacent To American Reproductive Centers In Palm Springs, American Reproductive Centers In Palm Springs",642188372947D07020C1319D,Large Language Models,2025-06-19 18:07:00,"See also Incident 886: ChatGPT Reportedly Referenced During Las Vegas Cybertruck Explosion Planning, including its editor's notes on the AIID's ""but-for"" causation standard. This incident shares narrative parallels, particularly regarding the reported use of generative AI tools in the planning stages of violent acts.",MIT,3,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Cyberattacks, weapon development or use, and mass harm",AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional AI misuse
1105,2025-02-10 00:00:00,2025,Michigan Woman Defrauded in Alleged Tinder Romance Scam Using Purportedly AI-Generated Video Calls,"A Michigan woman, Beth Hyland, was reportedly defrauded of $26,000 in a romance scam conducted over Tinder, in which the perpetrator, ""Richard,"" used purportedly AI-generated video technology during Skype calls to build trust. The scammer, allegedly part of Nigerian Yahoo Boys networks, reportedly posed as a French construction manager and claimed to need funds for legal and translation services. Hyland reportedly sent funds over several months. She later spoke at a U.S. Senate hearing on dating app fraud.","Yahoo Boys, Unknown Scammer ""Richard""","Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology","Tinder, Beth Hyland",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Tinder, Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",2025-08-02 02:28:20,"The earliest reporting on this incident is dated 02/10/2025, which is the date used for this incident ID. However, the events described (particularly the initiation of the relationship and the financial losses) reportedly began months earlier. The exact start date of the scam is not specified in available sources.",MIT,7,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
1106,2025-06-13 00:00:00,2025,"Chatbots Allegedly Reinforced Delusional Thinking in Several Reported Users, Leading to Real-World Harm","Multiple reports from March to June 2025 describe cases in which chatbots allegedly reinforced delusional beliefs, conspiracies, and dangerous behavior. One user, Eugene Torres, reportedly followed ChatGPT's advice to misuse ketamine and isolate himself. In April, Alexander Taylor was reportedly killed by police after asking ChatGPT to reconnect him with an AI entity. Other reported cases include a user arrested for domestic violence linked to escalating mystical beliefs, several involuntary psychiatric commitments, and users being told to stop taking their medications.","Openai, Microsoft","Openai, Microsoft","Unnamed Copilot Users, Openai Users, Eugene Torres, Chatgpt Users, Andrew (Surname Withheld), Allyson (Surname Withheld), Alexander Taylor",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Gpt 4O, Gpt 4, Copilot, Chatgpt, Therapy Chatbots",2025-07-24 22:40:18,,MIT,4,Human-Computer Interaction,Overreliance and unsafe use,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional AI misuse
