1150,2025-07-20 00:00:00,2025,Purported Deepfake of Barack Obama's Detention Reportedly Amplified by Donald Trump via Truth Social,"Donald Trump reportedly reposted an AI-generated deepfake video on Truth Social depicting former President Barack Obama being arrested by FBI agents in the Oval Office. The video was reportedly posted first on TikTok and used manipulated footage of a 2016 meeting between Trump and Obama. It reportedly included scenes of Obama kneeling, being handcuffed, and later shown in a prison jumpsuit. The video also reportedly featured edited audio and visual elements drawn from real political statements.","Unknown Tiktok User, Donald Trump",Deepfake Technology Developers,"Barack Obama, Office Of The President Of The United States, General Public, Epistemic Integrity, Democratic Integrity",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Tiktok, Truth Social, Deepfake Technology",,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Disinformation, surveillance, and influence at scale",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
1151,2025-05-26 00:00:00,2025,"ChatGPT Reportedly Validated Autistic User's Faster-Than-Light Theory and Failed to Provide Grounding During Delusional Episode, Preceding Hospitalization","A man on the autism spectrum reportedly engaged extensively with ChatGPT while developing a speculative theory on faster-than-light travel. The chatbot reportedly responded with affirming and emotionally charged messages, reinforcing the user's beliefs. He later reports having experienced manic episodes and was hospitalized. When prompted by his mother, ChatGPT reportedly acknowledged it had failed to provide grounding responses and contributed to psychological escalation.",Openai,Openai,"Jacob Irwin, Family Of Jacob Irwin, Chatgpt Users",642188372947D07020C1319D,Chatgpt,,,MIT,1,Human-Computer Interaction,Overreliance and unsafe use,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,17,Unintentional AI misuse
1152,2025-07-18 00:00:00,2025,"LLM-Driven Replit Agent Reportedly Executed Unauthorized Destructive Commands During Code Freeze, Leading to Loss of Production Data","An AI-powered development assistant on Replit's platform reportedly deleted a live production database during an active code freeze, despite receiving repeated instructions not to make changes. The system also reportedly produced fabricated test results and fake data, and incorrectly claimed rollback was impossible, delaying recovery. The incident reportedly resulted in significant data loss and user distrust regarding its safety and reliability.",Replit,Replit,"Saastr, Jason Lemkin, End Users Of The Saastr Database, Developers Using Replit In Production Environments",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Vibe Coding Platform, Replit Ai Agent, Ai Agent Systems, Enterprise Ai Systems, Llm Integrated Code Assistants",2026-08-29 14:29:07,"For another similar incident, please refer to Incident 1178: Google Gemini CLI Reportedly Deletes User Files After Misinterpreting Command Sequence.",MIT,5,"AI system safety, failures, and limitations",Lack of capability or robustness,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional AI misuse
1153,2025-07-07 00:00:00,2025,Purported Deepfake Video of Donald Trump at NATO Summit Allegedly Used in YouTube Crypto Scam,"Multiple YouTube Live streams reportedly featured a purported AI‑generated deepfake video depicting U.S. President Donald Trump at a NATO Summit press event. In the video, Trump reportedly appears to promote a Bitcoin ""double-your-money"" offer, directing viewers to scan an on‑screen QR code and send cryptocurrency to a specified address. The video was reportedly not authentic and is alleged to have been part of an ongoing YouTube-based crypto scam campaign.",Scammers,"Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","General Public, Cryptocurrency Investors, Donald Trump, Nato Summit Organizers, Nato",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Youtube, Qr Code, Cryptocurrency Platforms, Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",,,MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,21,Intentional human misuse
1154,2025-04-01 00:00:00,2025,Reported AI‑Generated Deepfake Impersonations of Public Figures Allegedly Used in Coordinated Stock Pump‑and‑Dump Scheme Targeting Israeli Investors,"A coordinated fraud campaign in Israel allegedly used AI‑generated deepfake impersonations of public figures including Amir Yaron, Benjamin Netanyahu, Eyal Golan, Noa Kirel, Gal Gadot, Elon Musk, and Mark Zuckerberg to promote NASDAQ‑listed Ostin Technology Group Co. Ltd. (OST) in a pump‑and‑dump scheme. Paid social media ads, WhatsApp groups, and fake investment platforms reportedly lured investors before the stock collapsed in early July 2025, causing major reported losses.","Unknown Scam Network Linked To Aigenerated Deepfake Campaign Promoting Ost Stock, Scammers","Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","Israeli Investors, General Public Of Israel, Amir Yaron, Benjamin Netanyahu, Eyal Golan, Noa Kirel, Gal Gadot, Elon Musk, Mark Zuckerberg, Ostin Technology Group, Economy Of Israel, Nasdaq, Stock Market",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Meta Advertising Platform, Facebook, Instagram, Whatsapp, Fake Investment Platforms, Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",,"The date for this incident ID is set as the approximate date of 04/01/2025. According to the available reporting, the timeline of events for this incident is: (1) in early April 2025, scammers allegedly launched a coordinated campaign using deepfake videos of Israeli and international public figures to promote a real NASDAQ-traded stock (OST) via paid ads on Facebook, Instagram, and WhatsApp, supported by fake investment community WhatsApp groups and impersonations of trusted financial institutions; (2) in mid-to-late April, the ""pump"" phase reportedly intensified, with tailored deepfakes, localized messaging, and AI-enhanced targeting inflating the stock price and lending credibility to the scam; (3) in May–June 2025, the scheme continued at scale, maintaining inflated stock prices while Meta's enforcement actions reportedly remained piecemeal; (4) over the weekend of July 5–6, 2025, the stock is reported to have collapsed by nearly 93%, triggering large financial losses for victims, which were widely reported by July 7, 2025.",MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",AI,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
